{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) ≥ 2 ∧ ndim(v_2) ≥ 2 ∧ ndim(v_1) = ndim(v_2) - 1 then (∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 2] : shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, i) ∨ shape(v_1, i) = 1 ∨ shape(v_2, i) = 1)
